# 🧠 Manual CAPTCHA

**Manual CAPTCHA** is a simple yet effective visual CAPTCHA system built with PHP and HTML/CSS. It generates a randomized visual code made of 7 characters distorted with various styles (rotation, skew, font weight, opacity, etc.), and overlays it with randomized lines and dots to prevent easy OCR decoding. Users must manually type the correct code to proceed.

